LineageOS Bass x86
===========

Getting started
---------------

LineageOS 24.0 (Android 17) with the x86 hardware layer used by Bass:Lineout.

To initialize your local repository, use a command like this:
```
repo init -u https://github.com/los-tv-x86/lineage_bass_android.git -b lineage-24.0 --git-lfs
```
Then to sync up:
```
repo sync
```

Bass-Core is the public x86 layer. The x86 additions live in `android-x86/`:
`05-modified.xml` swaps the Lineage/AOSP projects that carry x86 changes for their
los-tv-x86 lineage-24.0 forks, and `02`-`04` add the x86 hardware, graphics and
device repos.

Downstream products add their own repos through local manifests, never through
this one.
